+                                   ---                        |
+                                  |   |                       v
+ Process incoming                 | I |                 -------------
+  IOTP Message &   <------------- |   | ------------ | IOTP Message |
+generate next IOTP                |   |                 -------------
+     Message                      | N |
+        |                         |   |
+        v                         |   |
+  -------------                   | T |              Process incoming
+ | IOTP Message |  -------------- |   | ----------->  IOTP Message &
